# EVO-8 前向纸面轨：决策记录**必须**入库——冻结的时序证明靠「决策 commit 是 freeze_sha 的
# DAG 后代」，被 ignore 掉就等于该轮证据不存在（工部 2026-08-10 第 1 轮起跑时发现并修）。
!reports/llm_paper/
data/cache/
# EVO tooling (工部/都水): derived Qlib .bin store + CSV intermediates are
# rebuildable from committed data/daily_full via tools/qlib_gen/build_qlib_data.py
data/qlib_store/
*.parquet
# EVO-24: the delivered adjusted daily bars ARE committed (real OpenD qfq data)
# so the serial 真跑 step reads them from the branch without re-hitting the
# 30-day historical-K quota. Ad-hoc parquet elsewhere stays ignored.
!data/daily/*.parquet
# EVO-130: full-depth (2006→) swing dataset — committed for reproducible
# walk-forward without re-hitting the 30-day historical-K quota.
!data/daily_full/*.parquet
# EVO-25 candidate-8: committed ETP execution snapshots + carry report
!data/vix_etp/*.parquet
!reports/carry_vixts_svxy/
!reports/carry_vixts_svix/
# EVO-8 candidate A (rate carry): FRED yield-curve panel is committed for
# offline reproducible backtest (free/keyless source, small file)
!data/fred_yields.parquet
# EVO-8 candidate A universe bars (BIL/IEF/TLT total-return daily), gathered
# from sibling branches into A's data dir; committed for offline reproducibility
!data/rate_carry/*.parquet
# EVO-8 candidate C credit-spread signal (BAA10YM latest + vintage samples via
# FRED API point-in-time); small, committed for offline reproducible backtest
!data/credit_baa10ym_latest.parquet
!data/credit_baa10ym_vintages.parquet
